					</span> </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-9db5243 cpel-lv--yes elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="9db5243" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section"> <div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"> <div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-fa8104c" data-id="fa8104c" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column" data-settings='{"background_background":"classic"}'> <div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"> <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7559957 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="7559957" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"> <div class="elementor-widget-container"> <div class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Interested in hosting your event at Várkert Bazaar? Request a personalised proposal.</div> </div> </div> <div class="vamtam-has-theme-widget-styles elementor-element elementor-element-3fcbc37 elementor-align-center vamtam-has-underline-anim elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="3fcbc37" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default"> <div class="elementor-widget-container"> <div class="elementor-button-wrapper"> <a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="https://budapestpartyservice.hu/en/corporate-enquiry/"> <span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
